    ]
  },
  "notes": [
    "Decouple VCC with 100 nF at pin 8.",
    "The IQ ordering option has quad mode fixed on (QE = 1): /WP and /HOLD act as IO2 and IO3, so the write-protect and hold functions are not available.",
    "Keep CLK and the IO lines short and of similar length at high clock rates; a series resistor (22-33 ohm) at the controller's CLK pin damps ringing."
  ],
